{"hw":"ἀμφίπολις","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀμφίπολις</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀμφίπολις</span>, poet. <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀμφίπτολις</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">encompassing city,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἀνάγκη ἀμφίπτολις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ch.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">75</span> </span> (lyr.). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Subst.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἀ., <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>,</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">city encompassed by a river,</b> as pr. n., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.102</span> </span>, etc.</div></div>"}